289	 * Curated "Most downloaded" rail — real `GameMod.downloads`, DB-side sorted
290	 * and DB-side filtered to `downloads: { not: null }`. That filter matters:
291	 * Postgres' default NULLS FIRST for a DESC sort would otherwise put every
292	 * never-verified (downloads: null) row ahead of real numbers — see the
293	 * `rust`/`cs2` families, which currently have zero mods with a real
294	 * `downloads` count and so correctly return an empty array here rather than
